 "words": 317,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The high priest carries blood of animals",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 10.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Into the holy place with care",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 10.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But their bodies are burned outside the camp",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 10.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A ritual beyond the air",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 10.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus suffered outside the gate",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 10.39,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To make the people holy and new",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 9.65,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Through his own blood we are set apart",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 7.99,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From the old and fading view",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 8.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For here we have no lasting city",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 5.44,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We look for the one that is to come",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.78,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "No permanent home in this world",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.44,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Only the promise we have found",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.82,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For here we have no lasting city",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.12,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We look for the one that is to come",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let us go out to him outside the camp",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bearing the disgrace he bore",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We join him in the way of suffering",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the sake of his love forevermore",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.73,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Through him we offer praise continually",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.13,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The fruit of lips that confess his name",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not neglect to do good and share",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For such sacrifices please God's fame",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
